--- !u!114 &1849754534
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1849754533}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a6989466901774546af9c8c3e426e377, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayer: {fileID: 1350976805}
  messages1:
  - Hi there, you look like a new face!
  - You never know who is going to be at the market when you visit.
  - If you visit often, you'll probably hear some great farming tips!
  - Although some people have better advice than others...
  messages2:
  - How rude of me! I forgot to introduce myself last time we met.
  - 'Sarah: My name is Sarah, and I run the farm down the road.'
  - 'Sarah: Last season, I gave my crops 30 inches of water each and they did great.'
  - 'Sarah: But when I did the same thing this season, they didn''t do so well.'
  - 'Sarah: I probably should have looked at how much it rained.'
  messages3:
  - 'Sarah: Did you notice that you can now see nitrate levels for each of your crops?'
  - 'Sarah: Some people say nitrates are important for crop growth.'
  messages4:
  - 'Sarah: Geez, bean prices have really fallen, huh.'
  - 'Sarah: Makes sense, though. They need less water to survive.'
  - 'Sarah: And corn prices have skyrocketed!'
  - 'Sarah: I might wait until next year to sell my beans.'
