--- !u!114 &1861787251
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1861787249}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a6989466901774546af9c8c3e426e377, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayer: {fileID: 1350976805}
  messages1:
  - 'John: Hi, my name is John!'
  - 'John: I come to the market almost every season to buy new things and sell my
    crops.'
  - 'John: My mom caught me taking the tractor to school yesterday...'
  - 'John: And now she says I need to buy my own car!'
  - 'John: I also wanted to buy a new pair of pants...'
  - 'John: I wonder which crop makes the most profit?'
  messages2:
  - 'John: Have you unlocked the new crop yet?'
  - 'John: I was so excited, I bought 100 packs of seeds!'
  - 'John: But when I gave them as much water as the corn, they didn''t grow nearly
    as well.'
  - 'John: I guess I''ll experiment with different amounts of water.'
  messages3:
  - 'John: I just noticed a new upgrade I think you''d be interested in: the silo!'
  - 'John: With the old system, you can only store a total of 200 crops in your inventory.'
  - 'John: But the silo doubles your storage space, so you can keep your crops for
    several more seasons.'
  messages4:
  - 'John: Ugh, this drought is really cutting into my finances.'
  - 'John: The irrigation system is a great buy, though.'
  - 'John: It cuts your water use in half!'
